      technique: ['sublimation', 'Friedel–Crafts acylation of a metallocene', 'microscale reaction under a septum', 'neutralisation', 'Hirsch filtration', 'TLC on alumina (choosing a solvent)', 'column chromatography with dry loading', 'melting points in sealed capillaries'],
