      technique: ['anhydrous technique (oven-dried glass, septum, syringe)', 'forming a Grignard reagent', 'nucleophilic addition to a ketone', 'acid work-up', 'washing and drying', 'evaporation under a gas stream', 'trituration', 'recrystallisation', 'TLC'],
