          text: 'Collect the recrystallised solid on a Hirsch funnel and wash it with ice-cold 95% ethanol. Weigh it, work out the percent yield and take a melting point; record ¹H NMR (in d₆-DMSO) and IR, and submit an NMR tube for an overnight ¹³C spectrum.',
